# CLIENT_BASE project — agent operating rules

## Always use

| Artifact | Path |
|----------|------|
| Feature README | `.cursor/client-base-project/README.md` |
| Analysis + sim (locked policy) | `.cursor/client-base-project/ANALYSIS_AND_SIMULATION.md` |
